#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:33
#: ba45ae023b284fff8055396b259df2ea
msgid ""
"Both Pico and Meta Quest support **WebXR (Vuer)** and **XRoboToolkit** "
"backends. Launch from **fa-py-libraries** (`./init.sh all` first). There is "
"no `./run.sh vr --mode` flag."
msgstr ""
"Pico 和 Meta Quest 都支持 **WebXR (Vuer)** 和 **XRoboToolkit** 后端。从 **fa-py-"
"libraries** 启动（先 `./init.sh all`）。没有 `./run.sh vr --mode` 参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:35
#: 1920e713c274474586da54b5e76b0c2c
msgid "Web Mode (WebXR/Vuer)"
msgstr "Web 模式（WebXR/Vuer）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:37
#: 88070fb2474e4f81b1cddb85b76f2efe
msgid ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr"
msgstr ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:42
#: 6a7ab23cf4c0450188f3d1e9591c17e2
msgid "Opens a WebXR session accessible from the VR headset browser."
msgstr "打开可从 VR 头显浏览器访问的 WebXR 会话。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:44
#: 591c01e736364665907d63590cd170e9
